{"kind":"stack","id":"s-living-groups","title":"Grouping living things","theme":{"background":"#f4f9f1","foreground":"#1d3b1f","font":"Georgia, serif"}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c1","kind":"flash","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c1-term","content":"Living things"},{"type":"text","id":"c1-def","content":"Living things grow, need food, breathe and reproduce. Plants and animals are both living things."},{"type":"button","id":"c1-next","label":"Next Card","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c2"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c2","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"image","picto":"tree"},{"type":"text","id":"c2-q","content":"Which of these is a plant?"},{"type":"button","id":"c2-a","label":"Oak tree","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c3"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c2-b","label":"Rock","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c3"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c2-c","label":"Cloud","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c3"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c3","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c3-q","content":"Which group does a cat belong to?"},{"type":"button","id":"c3-a","label":"Animals","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c4"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c3-b","label":"Plants","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c4"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c3-c","label":"Fungi","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c4"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c4","kind":"flash","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c4-term","content":"Grouping"},{"type":"text","id":"c4-def","content":"Grouping means sorting living things into sets that share features, such as animals with backbones or plants with flowers."},{"type":"button","id":"c4-next","label":"Next Card","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c5"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c5","kind":"story","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c5-q","content":"You find a new creature in a pond. How do you start to sort it?"},{"type":"button","id":"c5-a","label":"Check if it has a backbone","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c6"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c5-b","label":"Check what colour it is","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c7"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c6","kind":"story","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c6-t","content":"Good choice! A backbone is a useful feature. It helps scientists sort animals into groups."},{"type":"button","id":"c6-next","label":"Continue","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c8"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c7","kind":"story","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c7-t","content":"Colour can change with the seasons or with light, so it is not a reliable way to group living things."},{"type":"button","id":"c7-next","label":"Continue","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c8"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c8","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c8-q","content":"Which feature is best for grouping plants?"},{"type":"button","id":"c8-a","label":"Whether they have flowers","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c9"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c8-b","label":"Whether they are green","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c9"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c8-c","label":"Whether they are tall","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c9"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c9","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c9-q","content":"Which living thing is a fungus?"},{"type":"button","id":"c9-a","label":"Mushroom","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c10"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c9-b","label":"Frog","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c10"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c9-c","label":"Fern","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c10"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c10","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c10-q","content":"How many groups are living things sorted into in this lesson's example?"},{"type":"button","id":"c10-a","label":"Three","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c11"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c10-b","label":"Two","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c11"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c10-c","label":"Five","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c11"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c11","kind":"end","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c11-h","content":"Well done! You finished the grouping quiz."},{"type":"text","id":"c11-m","content":"Living things can be grouped in many ways. Keep looking for the features that connect them."}],"actions":[]}}
